# NỘI DUNG CẦN LÀM:
# - make install    → pip install -r requirements.txt
# - make run        → chạy FastAPI + Streamlit local
# - make test       → pytest tests/
# - make build      → docker build
# - make up         → docker-compose up
# - make lint       → flake8/ruff check
# - make schema     → chạy schema indexer (1 lần)